Output help_demo.gif
Set Theme "GruvboxDarkHard"
Set Padding 24

Set FontSize 24 
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600

Type@0s "uv run consortium.py client"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type@0.1s listeners
Enter
Sleep 1s 


Type@0.1s help
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type@0.1s help rename
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type@0.1s "alias --help"
Enter
Sleep 2s
